'''Nord Greatsword''' is the third, [[Deep North]]-tier two-handed [[Swords|sword]].

* The primary attack is a wide 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* Its slower secondary attack is a thrust that deals 3x damage.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Greatsword]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Greatsword''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Greatsword can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Greatsword}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Greatsword}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

An upgraded Nord Greatsword will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

